   "type": "p",
   "text": "Choosing a CPA firm from your dental practice should be based on more than personal recommendations from your friends in the industry. Yes, word of mouth information is a good place to start when it comes to selecting a dental CPA, but it could be a mistake merely to take someone else’s word for it. Instead, take the time to truly research what makes a dental business consultant reputable and helpful. We at Reliance Consulting, LLC, submit that we have what it takes to help your dental practice reach profitability and stay there.",
